    m_Localized: Shareholders, staff and customers may judge {company} differently.
      Who bears the cost and who benefits is central.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1383698610
    m_Localized: '{company}''s share price does not tell the whole story. Its ties
      with {community} can also have long-term effects.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1383698611
    m_Localized: Rules favoring {company} may burden its rivals. Effects on the industry
      and the individual firm should be separated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1383698612
    m_Localized: Even shareholders who trust {company}'s past performance still need
      to assess this decision. Attachment to a company is distinct from the quality
      of its evidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1383698613
    m_Localized: Existing users and customers of competing services may view {company}'s
      initiative differently. Familiarity itself can shape their assessment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1383698614
    m_Localized: Distinguish recurring revenue from one-off factors in {company}'s
      earnings. Whether this change will last still requires verification.
