      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087585
    m_Localized: I mean that. What would change your view of {symbol}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087586
    m_Localized: I mean that. My attention keeps returning to {symbol}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087587
    m_Localized: I mean that. I separate {symbol} rumors from actual fills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087588
    m_Localized: I mean that. Have I missed any news about {symbol}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087589
    m_Localized: I mean that. What are you watching most closely in {symbol}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087590
    m_Localized: I mean that. I am looking for follow-through in {symbol}, not a
