      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087595
    m_Localized: I mean that. The same circumstances can lead to different judgments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087596
    m_Localized: I mean that. Your explanation seems to arrive before the result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087597
    m_Localized: I mean that. I appreciate the reluctance to rush to a conclusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087598
    m_Localized: I mean that. You keep twisting my words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
