    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087608
    m_Localized: I mean that. It must be nice to be so certain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087609
    m_Localized: I mean that. I understand how you reached that view.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087610
    m_Localized: I mean that. There is no need to rush to recover the loss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1392087611
    m_Localized: I mean that. Staying does not seem likely to help. I am leaving.
