  - m_Id: 480603803324416
    m_Localized: Took profit on part of {stockName}. Holding the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878848
    m_Localized: Trimmed about half of {stockName}. I can watch calmly now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878849
    m_Localized: Sold a bit of {stockName} for profit. The rest is a bonus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878850
    m_Localized: Partial profit on {stockName}. Kept some, couldn't sell it all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878851
    m_Localized: I took partial profit on {stockName}. I'll watch the rest a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878852
    m_Localized: I closed part of {stockName} at a gain. The rest stays as planned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878853
    m_Localized: Dumped part of {stockName}. The rest rides to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878854
    m_Localized: Sold some {stockName} and banked it. Holding the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878855
    m_Localized: Cut part of {stockName}. Couldn't dump it all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878856
    m_Localized: Reduced {stockName}. Sold at a loss, so it stings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878857
    m_Localized: I closed part of {stockName} at a loss. Reducing seemed right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878858
    m_Localized: Partial stop on {stockName}. Trimmed before it got worse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878859
    m_Localized: Congratulations. A fine result.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878860
    m_Localized: Congrats on the gain. Good luck the rest of the way!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878861
    m_Localized: I envy you. I hope you keep it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878862
    m_Localized: Great call. Best of luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878863
    m_Localized: Your good result cheers me up too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878864
    m_Localized: Congratulations. I hope you reach your exit safely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878865
    m_Localized: Impressive. I'd like to learn from you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878866
    m_Localized: Nicely played. Hope it keeps going.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878867
    m_Localized: Oh, congrats. Lucky you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878868
    m_Localized: Jealous, ngl. GLTA!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878869
    m_Localized: Nice. Keeping the profit is half the job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878870
    m_Localized: Congrats! Hope I get a day like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878871
    m_Localized: Wow, nice. Lock it in to the end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878872
    m_Localized: Congrats. I'll borrow some of that luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878873
    m_Localized: GLTA! Seriously jealous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878874
    m_Localized: Well done. Eat something good today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878875
    m_Localized: Oh, congrats. Lucky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878876
    m_Localized: Jealous. Go get it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878877
    m_Localized: Good. Keeping it is the skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878878
    m_Localized: Congrats. Next time it's me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878879
    m_Localized: Lucky. Lock it in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878880
    m_Localized: Fair. Today's your day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878881
    m_Localized: GL. Not gonna lie, jealous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878882
    m_Localized: Well done. Just don't get greedy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878883
    m_Localized: If you haven't sold, it isn't a locked gain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878884
    m_Localized: Lucky you. Whether it holds tomorrow is another matter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878885
    m_Localized: You can brag after you take profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878886
    m_Localized: It may simply have been luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878887
    m_Localized: You only get talkative when you're up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878888
    m_Localized: Sigh... did that need saying here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878889
    m_Localized: Congratulations, though it sounds a bit much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878890
    m_Localized: I recall you were quiet during your last loss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878891
    m_Localized: Sigh... here to brag?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878892
    m_Localized: It's just a number until you sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878893
    m_Localized: Lucky you~ not sure that's skill though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878894
    m_Localized: It stings, please stop haha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878895
    m_Localized: Tell me again if it's still there tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878896
    m_Localized: You only show up when you're winning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878897
    m_Localized: Yes, yes, very impressive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878898
    m_Localized: Brag after you cash out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878899
    m_Localized: Sigh... bragging again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878900
    m_Localized: Not your money until you sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878901
    m_Localized: That's luck, not skill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878902
    m_Localized: It stings. Stop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878903
    m_Localized: You'll hand it back tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878904
    m_Localized: Only around when it's up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878905
    m_Localized: Sure, good for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878906
    m_Localized: Sell first, then talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878907
    m_Localized: Pardon me, is that true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878908
    m_Localized: I wonder when you bought.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878909
    m_Localized: ?? Have you double-checked that figure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878910
    m_Localized: I wonder if you read your average correctly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878911
    m_Localized: That timing is hard to believe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878912
    m_Localized: Did you sell, or are you still holding?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878913
    m_Localized: Impressive if true. I'd like the basis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878914
    m_Localized: Was that much gain even possible there?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878915
    m_Localized: ?? Really?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878916
    m_Localized: When did you buy to get that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878917
    m_Localized: Hard to believe without proof, haha.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878918
    m_Localized: Sure you read your average right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878919
    m_Localized: That timing is too good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878920
    m_Localized: Sold, or still holding?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878921
    m_Localized: Oh, come on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878922
    m_Localized: ?? That works?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878923
    m_Localized: ?? For real.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878924
    m_Localized: When'd you buy to get that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878925
    m_Localized: No proof, no belief.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878926
    m_Localized: You read your average right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878927
    m_Localized: Timing's too good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878928
    m_Localized: Sold or holding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878929
    m_Localized: Anyone wins in words.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878930
    m_Localized: ??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878931
    m_Localized: May I ask what price you bought at?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878932
    m_Localized: What is your selling plan?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878933
    m_Localized: Do you think {symbol} is still fine to enter?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878934
    m_Localized: What did you see when you bought?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878935
    m_Localized: Do you see more upside?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878936
    m_Localized: How large is your position?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878937
    m_Localized: Since when have you held it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878938
    m_Localized: Where is your target?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878939
    m_Localized: What price did you get in at?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878940
    m_Localized: When do you plan to sell?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878941
    m_Localized: Is {symbol} okay to enter now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878942
    m_Localized: What made you buy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878943
    m_Localized: Think it goes further?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878944
    m_Localized: How much did you put in?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878945
    m_Localized: Since when have you held?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878946
    m_Localized: How far are you looking?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878947
    m_Localized: What price'd you get in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878948
    m_Localized: When're you selling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878949
    m_Localized: Can I still ride {symbol}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878950
    m_Localized: What'd you see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878951
    m_Localized: Think it goes more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878952
    m_Localized: How big's the position.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878953
    m_Localized: Since when've you held.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878954
    m_Localized: How far're you looking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878955
    m_Localized: That was hard. Rest a little today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878956
    m_Localized: It happens to everyone. Don't blame yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878957
    m_Localized: Best of luck! The next one will go better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878958
    m_Localized: Cutting a loss is a decision. You did well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878959
    m_Localized: The market opens tomorrow too. Cheer up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878960
    m_Localized: Sigh... that must weigh on you. Stay strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878961
    m_Localized: I've been through the same. It passes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878962
    m_Localized: Good luck! Look after yourself first right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878963
    m_Localized: Sigh... that was really rough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878964
    m_Localized: Everyone goes through it once. It's okay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878965
    m_Localized: GL! You'll be smiling next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878966
    m_Localized: Stop checking the account and rest today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878967
    m_Localized: Cutting losses is a skill. Good cut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878968
    m_Localized: Same here once. It passed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878969
    m_Localized: Make sure you eat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878970
    m_Localized: Hang in there. Market opens tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878971
    m_Localized: Sigh... rough one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878972
    m_Localized: Everyone gets trapped. It's fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878973
    m_Localized: GL. Next one's a winner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878974
    m_Localized: Close the account and rest today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878975
    m_Localized: Cutting losses is skill. Good cut.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 480603836878976
    m_Localized: Been there. It passes.
    m_Metadata:
